      "kind" : "edit.markdownNote",
      "parameters" : {
        "text" : "# Flarefun · Steer the flurry\nDrag the Trackpad crosshair to move the smoke across the frame. Its center (0.5, 0.5) matches the original flurry position. X moves left to right; Y moves top to bottom. The GPU Program samples the latest position for each 60 Hz frame without restarting its 3,600-particle simulation. Earlier smoke remains in the fading frame history, creating a trail as you move. Reset centers the flurry. Width and Height control the render and saved image size; changing either restarts the simulation. FlarefunProgram.metal sits beside this workflow."
      },
